Package: life-toolbox
Version: 1.0.006
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: qishiyi <qishiyi77@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: Life Toolbox WebUI application for TOS
 Offline daily utility toolbox with date, unit, BMI,
 discount, tip, fuel, loan, picker, and password tools.
 The WebUI communicates with a local Python service over
 the TOS Unix socket proxy.
